ot shared with the Claude User's account\\\"\\n    - when:\\n        - \\\"the Claude User asks Claude to summarize that document\\\"\\n    - then:\\n        - \\\"Claude displays the message 'This document is not shared with your account'\\\"\\n        - \\\"Claude does not display any content from the document\\\"\\n\\n- ac_id: AC-3\\n  description: \\\"Claude must display the message 'The summary timed out - please try again' in the conversation, and display no summary content, when no summary is produced within 30 seconds of the Claude User's request.\\\"\\n  steps:\\n    - given:\\n        - \\\"a Google Doc is shared with the Claude User's account\\\"\\n        - \\\"the summary backend does not respond within 30 seconds\\\"\\n    - when:\\n        - \\\"the Claude User asks Claude to summarize the document\\\"\\n    - then:\\n        - \\\"Claude displays the message 'The summary timed out - please try again'\\\"\\n        - \\\"Claude displays no summary content\\\"\\n\\n- ac_id: AC-4\\n  description: \\\"Claude must state that only the first 10000 words were summarized when the document contains more than 10000 words.\\\"\\n  steps:\\n    - given:\\n        - \\\"a Google Doc with more than 10000 words is shared with the Claude User's account\\\"\\n    - when:\\n        - \\\"the Claude User asks Claude to summarize the document\\\"\\n    - then:\\n        - \\\"Claude displays a summary of the first 10000 words\\\"\\n        - \\\"Claude states that only the first 10000 words were summarized\\\"\\n```\\n\\n## Verification\\n\\nAfter applying, each AC description checks clean against `vocabulary.forbidden_qualifiers` (properly, correctly, appropriate, appropriately, user-friendly, fast, quickly, easily, seamless, intuitive):\\n\\n- AC-1: ok\\n- AC-2: ok\\n- AC-3: ok\\n- AC-4: ok\\n\\nEvery step uses the exact role from the story's `as_a` clause, \\\"Claude User\\\".\\n\\n=== FILE_END: tmp/{{RUN_DIR}}/01-doc-summary-fix-prompts.md ===\", \"questions\": []}"}